    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3034a088-1c26-551f-b68a-4bb3bc368594"))
  (text "(G2 estimate, measure at G6; 1.8 k is the fallback). Devices: 0x20/0x21 expanders, 0x29 ToF (re-addressed),"
    (at 15.24 39.88 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0c5a93a2-b517-510f-954e-412c2e75339d"))
  (text "0x2C mag, 0x30 camera SCCB, 0x40 INA226, 0x6B charger (datasheet also says 0x6A), 0x76 baro."
